Package: ubuntu-mic-fixer
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Ubuntu Audio Fixer Team <support@ubuntu.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, pipewire, wireplumber, alsa-utils, snapd
Description: Ubuntu Mic & Audio Fixer
 Native GTK4/Libadwaita application and PipeWire background service for Ubuntu.
 Fixes microphone permissions for Snap apps (Firefox, Chromium), unmutes ALSA capture
 channels, auto-switches Bluetooth headset profiles during calls, and provides
 real-time VU meter and quick system audio reset.
